      "content": "Take a deep breath. You are capable of handling this, and we will break it down together. Let's look at the context of these lines. In this part of the novel, Absalom is speaking to his father, Kumalo, about the crime he committed. He is admitting his actions and his fear. Given that he is confessing to his father, how would you describe his emotional state?"
